> In a small bowl, combine fennel, capers,[ lemon] juice, parsley and olive oil and set aside.
Pre[heat] oven to 400°F.[ Lay] trout on a greased baking sheet. Stuff each fish with slices of[ red] onion,[ lemon], whole sprigs of parsley and oregano.[ Dri]zzle with olive oil and season with salt and pepper.
Bake 15 to 18 minutes or until fish is firm and flakey. Serve with fennel salad.

